      "url": "https://canadacollege.edu/prie/enrollmentreports/Canada%20PRIE%20Data%20Dashboard%20Dictionary_6-28-16.pdf",
      "summary": "The PRIE Data Dashboard Dictionary from Canada College outlines the structure and usage of the PRIE office Data Dashboard. It is composed of three data warehouses: Dashboards with IDs Warehouse, Dashboards without IDs Warehouse, and STEM Warehouse. The dashboard allows the user to filter student data by various parameters such as college, registration term, division, and subject. Unique entries can be made for student populations using the 'Load G Nums' feature, retrieving data from the SMCCD warehouse. A prominent feature is the Enrollment Warehouse, which contains 50 dimensions of student characteristics, described within the dictionary.",
