      "title": "Educational Master Plan",
      "url": "https://canadacollege.edu/emp/",
      "summary": "Cañada College's Educational Master Plan (EMP) outlines a five-year strategic vision for institutional growth and improvement from 2022 to 2027. It aims to align the college's mission, vision, and values with clear goals and strategies while being adaptable to changes in the economy and educational trends. The plan is intended to support the creation of other critical college plans in areas such as technology, facilities, and finance, ultimately promoting improvement for the college's diverse student body.",
      "stored": false,
      "fetched_at": "2026-05-26T16:13:43.588595+05:30"
    },
    {
      "doc_type": "strategic_plan",
      "year": 2020,
      "title": "Strategic Plan",
      "url": "https://canadacollege.edu/plans/",
      "summary": "Cañada College's strategic planning process is overseen by the Planning and Budgeting Council, which ensures all initiatives are integrated into an annual plan. Each year, a Leadership Retreat is held to assess the college's progress using EMP baseline metrics and to identify strategic priorities for the upcoming year. The planning cycle aims to seamlessly integrate planning, budgeting, and evaluation to optimize institutional effectiveness.",
